OL,3,GNEWSARacecourse reopens for 'new
OL,4,Achapter' next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular racecourse is due to "begin a
OL,7,Fnew chapter" by reopening its gates
OL,8,Fnext week.
OL,10,FThere have been no fixtures at
OL,11,FChelmsford City Racecourse since March
OL,12,Fafter the track's previous tenant,
OL,13,FGreat Leighs Estates Limited (GLEL),
OL,14,Fwent into administration with debts of
OL,15,Fmore than #22m.
OL,17,FThe racecourse, at Great Leighs to the
OL,18,Fnorth of Chelmsford, will host its
OL,19,Ffirst meeting ` an Autumn Evening Flat
OL,20,FRacing card ` under its new management
OL,21,Ffirm Arena Racing Company (ARC) on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
