OL,3,GNEWSARacecourse reopens for 'new
OL,4,Achapter' next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FARC operations director Kieran
OL,7,FGallagher previously said he was
OL,8,F"delighted" the site would be welcoming
OL,9,Fhorses and punters back to Essex's only
OL,10,Fracecourse.
